cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this specification, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fabric Vitals: a vendor-neutral health score for AI data-center fabrics — Specification, Rulebook and spec-sheet template"
version: "0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
abstract: "Fabric Vitals is an open method for scoring the health of AI data-center network fabrics. A Rulebook, identical for every fabric, says how fabrics are measured and judged; a Fabric Spec Sheet, declared by each fabric's owner before measurement, says what the fabric promises. Version 0.2 is a draft technical proposal for discussion; it is not a standard, and its Rulebook values are not yet set."
authors:
